{"id":"5c871aa4b6cc159e","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-p-closure.md","title":"thm-p-closure","display":"thm-p-closure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"],"display":"thm-p-closure","label":"93-thm-p-closure","aliases":["93-thm-p-closure"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-p-closure"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-p-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-p-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-p-closure-thm-p-closure\">thm-p-closure <code>thm-p-closure</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm P_{\\tau}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\\)</span> is the product constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}p\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to\n\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)=\\Bigl\\{\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf B;I,\\tau):\nI\\in V\\land\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K^I\n\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}p\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to\n\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)=\\Bigl\\{\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf B;I,\\tau):\nI\\in V\\land\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K^I\n\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Isomorphic copies belong to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm I_{\\tau}(\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K))\">\\(\\mathrm I_{\\tau}(\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K))\\)</span>, not necessarily to the constructor-level class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\">\\(\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-p-closure-thm-p-closure","text":"thm-p-closure `thm-p-closure`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)$, $\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}$, and $\\mathrm P_{\\tau}$ is from [[93-df-closure-operators]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}$ is the product constructor of [[93-df-product]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm P_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}p\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to\n\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)=\\Bigl\\{\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf B;I,\\tau):\nI\\in V\\land\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K^I\n\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm I_{\\tau}(\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)","display":false}],"bytes":981,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["260c377f5e1dcfdf","97b46a497e251f9f","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}